--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project is a study/reimplementation inspired by and derived in part from:

    Deep_Hierarchical_Classification
    https://github.com/Ugenteraan/Deep_Hierarchical_Classification
    Copyright (c) 2021 Ugenteraan Manogaran
    Licensed under the MIT License.

Portions of the loss formulation (the layer loss and the dependency loss
reproduced in losses.py for analysis) and the coarse-to-fine classifier head
in models.py follow that project's approach. Its MIT license terms are
reproduced above and continue to apply to those portions.

That work is in turn an unofficial implementation of:

    "Deep Hierarchical Classification for Category Prediction in E-commerce System"
    Wan et al., 2020 — https://arxiv.org/abs/2005.06692
